OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GThe Arod Quartet plays Haydn &
OL,6,     GTchaikovsky in a live recital
OL,7,     Gfrom Wigmore Hall, plus Brahms
OL,8,     Gand Liszt from the Ulster
OL,9,     GOrchestra, and pianist Elisabeth
OL,10,     GLeonskaja plays Shostakovich.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Chopin
OL,12,     GDonald Macleod enters the
OL,13,     GParisian world of Frederic
OL,14,     GChopin. Today, the young composer
OL,15,     Gtries to get himself noticed on
OL,16,     Gthe city's exclusive salon
OL,17,     Gcircuit.
OL,18,G1700FIn Tune
OL,19,     GPetroc Trelawny presents live
OL,20,     Gmusic in the studio from pianist
OL,21,     GFilippo Gorini and Gaelic singer
OL,22,     GRuairidh Gray.
